Building RNRC

Native Linux (Ubuntu 22.04 / 24.04 / 26.04)
------------------------------------------
See doc/build-unix.txt

  cd src && make -f makefile.unix        # RNRCd (CLI)
  qmake && make                          # RNRC-qt (GUI) from repo root

Windows cross-compile from Ubuntu 22.04
---------------------------------------
See doc/build-windows.txt

  ./compile-windows.sh                   # RNRCd.exe + RNRC-qt.exe (if mingw Qt present)

See also doc/readme-qt.rst for GUI qmake options.
